The '''Parrot Pet''' is an {{skl|Alchemy}} [[Pet]] that can be obtained from the [[Dark Auction]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Parrot Pet''' has a chance to appear in round 1, 3 or 4 of the [[Dark Auction]]. The {{Epic}} has an overall {{Green|22.706%}} chance to appear, and the {{Legendary}} has a {{Green|6.05%}} chance to appear.

Once the '''Parrot Pet''' appears, you must win the auction by paying more than all other players to obtain it.

== Stats ==
=== Flamboyant Perk Scaling ===
The {{AbilityName|Flamboyant}} perk does not scale linearly, but is calculated using this formula:
:<math>\left\lceil \frac{\text{Pet Level}}{100} \times (\text{Maxed Value} - 1) + 1\right\rceil</math>
:<math>\text{Maxed Value}</math> is the highest value of this variable. It differs between {{Epic}} and {{Legendary}} rarities.

