== Trivia ==
* The [[Grandma Wolf Pet]], [[Spirit Pet]], [[Bingo Pet]], [[Kuudra Pet]], [[Owl Pet]], and the '''Parrot Pet''' are the only pets that grant perks to the player even when they are not equipped.
* Parrots owned by players with any [[Rank]] will occasionally repeat what they say in the chat. The chance of a parrot repeating the player's message is {{Green|12.5%}}.<!--<ref>Based on a sample of 500 chat messages. Raw chat logs: https://pastebin.com/jxTK05hE</ref> (This is just a statistic based off of 500 chat messages sent by the helper Biscut)-->
**This used to only apply to {{Rank|yt}} and [[Rank|Staff Members]].
*If multiple legendary Parrots are held in the same pet menu, only the one with the higher level will give the [[God Potion|god potion]] boost.
*Prior to the {{Item|God Potion}}'s addition, this pet used to be used for god splashes for its duration extension effect.

